// The forced cast (ReallyForceSpellRES) ignores the creature's state, so it
// is only tried while the creature can act (not asleep, unconscious,
// stunned, held, panicked, confused...).
// Black mantidrake: while no enemy is in melee reach, it throws one
// corrosive tail spike (NY#MTDV, travelling dart) at each enemy it sees
// within reach - up to the ten nearest - once every 2 rounds. Each block
// adds its throw and Continue()s to the next one; the last block starts the
// timer. Otherwise it fights in melee.

IF
  See(NearestEnemyOf(Myself))
  Range(NearestEnemyOf(Myself),20)
  !Range(NearestEnemyOf(Myself),4)
  Range(NearestEnemyOf(Myself),20)
  !StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
  !CheckStatGT(Myself,0,HELD)
  !GlobalTimerNotExpired("NY#MTDVT","LOCALS")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    ReallyForceSpellRES("NY#MTDV",NearestEnemyOf(Myself))
    Continue()
END

